      "title": "POLITICAL UPDATE: Pappu Yadav Joins Parliament Protest Drama Over Ram Temple Donation Allegations",
      "description": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"536\">A fresh political controversy emerged during the opposition protest outside Parliament as ABP News spoke exclusively with independent MP Pappu Yadav after the demonstration. During the interaction, Pappu Yadav made strong remarks while referring to allegations related to the Ram Temple donation issue, triggering a heated exchange at the protest site. The visuals from the protest showed intense scenes where supporters and political workers were seen raising slogans and reacting strongly to the issue. Pappu Yadav questioned the alleged misuse of religious sentiments and said that matters connected with faith require transparency and accountability. The protest also witnessed references to political leaders, including Rahul Gandhi, with supporters making claims and counterclaims during the heated atmosphere. The exchange reflected the wider political battle between opposition parties and the ruling side over issues being raised inside and outside Parliament. The opposition has been using the protest platform to highlight multiple concerns, including demands for answers from the government and allegations related to various public issues. Leaders from different parties have participated in demonstrations as tensions continue to rise during the ongoing parliamentary session. The latest incident adds another layer to the political confrontation, with strong reactions from both sides. While opposition leaders are attempting to put pressure on the government through demonstrations, the ruling side has defended parliamentary procedures and questioned the manner of protests.</p>",
